SUMMARY:The Great War and Great Flu Come to the Mother Continent
DESCRIPTION:The First World War began in Africa on Aug 3\, 1914\, six days after hostilities began in Europe. Across the continent\, the miserable yoke of European imperialism was felt by local people forced into a conflict they did not ask for. Join us for an immersive historical evening exploring one of World War I’s most grueling theaters. We will screen “Chasing the Phantom”\, a 2007 Lucasfilm documentary that follows the legendary campaign of German General Paul von Lettow-Vorbeck\, the \\
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/the-great-war-and-great-flu-come-to-the-mother-continent/26365/
END:VEVENT
